# TPS patch for opensec-pi-subagents — per-agent + aggregate output tok/s
#
# Base:  opensec-git/opensec-pi-subagents master
#        commit 76fd35c4a5e814251badd1f7f523557d3ea7fcf9 (v0.20.9)
# Apply: git apply -p1 <this file>   (from the source root)
#
# What it adds (Agents widget + workflow card/inspector):
#   src/token-rate.ts              rolling 10 s sampler over cumulative OUTPUT
#                                  tokens; input/cache are excluded because they
#                                  step at API boundaries and spike the rate.
#                                  A counter reset (retried child) starts a new
